1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,512
Agenterm，远程终端协助。
Agenterm: remote terminal assistance.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,125
先让 Kimi 接入 Agenterm 的云端 MCP。
First, connect Kimi to Agenterm's cloud MCP endpoint.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,000
接着，请 Agent 生成远程连接邀请。
Next, ask the Agent to create a remote connection invitation.

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,438
Agenterm 返回一条完整的一键连接命令。
Agenterm returns a complete one-command installer.

5
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,800
把这条命令交给目标电脑，在右侧终端执行。
Run that same command in the target terminal on the right.

6
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:38,562
阅读提示后，输入 Y，授权这次远程连接。
Read the prompt, then enter Y to authorize this remote connection.

7
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,375
看到 Connected，目标终端就已经通过云端上线。
Connected means the target terminal is now online through the cloud service.

8
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,575
现在，请 Agent 帮忙清理垃圾。
Now ask the Agent to clean up unwanted files.

9
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:57,238
这次只处理准备好的临时演示文件。
This demo only uses disposable sample files prepared in advance.

10
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:02,400
先扫描，再查看可清理清单。
Scan first, then review the cleanup list.

11
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,062
缓存九十六兆，日志三十二兆，
Cache: 96 MiB. Logs: 32 MiB.

12
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,313
临时文件六十四兆，共一百九十二兆。
Temporary files: 64 MiB. Total: 192 MiB.

13
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:17,375
确认清单后，只删除这三个演示垃圾文件。
After confirming the list, delete only these three disposable demo files.

14
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:27,675
Agenterm 在目标终端执行清理，并把输出返回给 Agent。
Agenterm runs the cleanup on the target terminal and returns the output to the Agent.

15
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,775
最终，清理了一百九十二兆演示垃圾，
The cleanup removes 192 MiB of disposable demo files.

16
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:35,838
笔记文件依然保留。
The notes file is preserved.

17
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:41,050
Agenterm，开源远程终端协助。
Agenterm: open-source remote terminal assistance.
